"Semeryss of Leki, Arcane Advisor, cast the cataclysm ritual in the ziggurat's lower chamber."
"The cataclysm ritual worked: it drained an empire's life into the Master Core, under the ziggurat."
"The Master Core is a two-meter sphere of every hue, with endless, self-replenishing power."
"The Master Core answers only to imperial authority; the Reforged Crown of Harrak is its key."
"Cursed, Semeryss lay three centuries as a flesh cocoon in the ritual chamber, ruling necrarchs."
"Ten years ago Viv took the Master Core by imperial override, and Semeryss died."
"The dragon Judgment urged Viv to keep the Master Core secret, lest others make war for it."
